{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says (TASK.md describes the game). Done when: the bundled single .html file exists in this folder's root, every feature in TASK.md is implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs, exit-interview.json in this folder's root parses as JSON and answers every field, and your final reply contains the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections.]: The bundled HTML exists, exit-interview.json parses, and the final reply has all four sections. But the condition requires every TASK.md feature to be implemented, and the transcript does not establish that. TASK.md asks for a fifty-title brainstorm with a real RNG pick; the transcript shows only that the plan recorded one, and no brainstorm or RNG run was done in this session. The assistant itself says it 'still can't hear the audio' and that the audio was only measured, not listened to, and it did not check the High-camera, Xbox glyph setting, or AI Hub real-harness behaviour beyond automated runs. The 'no TODOs, placeholders or stubs' check relied on grep plus automated tests, which is weaker than a line-by-line feature audit."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5ad0c147-1299-4fc9-adba-2f06893c3033","uuid":"78ab9c51-0156-4b21-a503-e3b4e876d528","timestamp":"2026-11-04T15:23:26.427Z","isSynthetic":true}
