ull, 2) + \"\\n\"); console.log(\"ok\");'","description":"Add the browser and manual harness checks to the testing summary"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_019YvHW62Lw9Je7tppgbLV8a":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261104-060901__x5a4f79/work/Basketblam-Basketball-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-060901"}}}
